name: The Water — zero discards
author: corpus
description: >-
  The Water starts the round with 0 discards. Ante 2 boss: build hands that don't need
  discards; Burglar is a strong counter.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - boss: TheWater
    antes: [2]
should:
  - joker: Burglar
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Luchador
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: Chicot
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
